## Deliberate route-role collision

The isolated failure fixture declares incompatible owners for one route. The
human diagnostic identifies the stable code, exact primary location, related
owner, cause, and safe correction intent. `check` exits unsuccessfully and
does not publish a mixed artifact generation.

<!-- fadeno:include {"path":"examples/v1-app/expected/check-collision.txt","language":"text"} -->

`--explain` adds bounded semantic ownership and skipped-work information. It
does not execute application behavior again and does not predict runtime facts.

<!-- fadeno:include {"path":"examples/v1-app/expected/check-collision-explain.txt","language":"text"} -->

The normalized flow record is generated by the same packed scenario. It shows
